    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "T-that was... we were just talking about the past! Actually, we're friends of Kamui! He asked us to swing by his family's place to help him with something!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Winnie",
            "Aha! I knew it! These eyes and ears of mine have never failed me!",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
