        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "When I decided to join the Hunter Legion back then, they were still practically cannon fodder... meat shields the royals threw at the Mist to die. It wasn't some glorious calling.",
            15
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "I didn't want my family to worry, so... I left without telling anyone. Went off and joined the Legion on my own.",
            15
