    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "Sure, I became the Revenant Hunter after that, and I made the whole Legion stronger. But at the end of the day, it was still a dangerous life.",
            15
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "I was scared of putting them in danger. But even more than that... I was afraid they'd resent me for it. That's why I never came back all these years.",
            15
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "Even now... I still can't find the courage to face them.",
            15
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
